      <para> When \(x=0\) and \(x^2=0\), what is value of \(-2x^2\)? </para>
      <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
    </problem>
    <solution>
      <para>Correct! \(-2(0)^2=-2 \cdot 0=0\)</para>
